WEBVTT

00:07.500 --> 00:08.500
Are you all right?

00:08.790 --> 00:11.880
Yes, but what was that explosion?

00:12.080 --> 00:13.500
According to what the communications squad said,

00:13.500 --> 00:17.330
it seems to have come from outside,
but we still don't know the source.

00:17.540 --> 00:18.460
I see.

00:19.170 --> 00:23.920
I just received a message that two of
the rescued children jumped into this cave.

00:24.080 --> 00:25.170
You're kidding me!

00:25.710 --> 00:27.380
What is Callum doing?!

00:27.830 --> 00:29.210
What were the children like?

00:29.580 --> 00:31.290
A male and a female, around ten years old.

00:31.290 --> 00:35.500
Details haven't been confirmed yet,
but they got away using a special water ability.

00:38.580 --> 00:41.880
Those damn kids!

02:12.790 --> 02:13.580
Sefec!

02:14.750 --> 02:15.500
Val!

02:19.380 --> 02:20.580
What happened to Kemet?

02:20.880 --> 02:23.380
Kemet... Kemet got...

02:23.920 --> 02:25.750
trapped over there!

02:23.920 --> 02:28.500
<b>"The Merciless Princess and the Order"</b>

02:30.710 --> 02:32.250
Why weren't you together?!

02:32.540 --> 02:34.130
The rubble fell down...

02:34.130 --> 02:35.080
Dammit!

02:42.420 --> 02:45.420
Tch... This isn't gonna work.

02:50.710 --> 02:53.170
This is bad! It's about to collapse!

02:53.750 --> 02:54.670
It can't!

02:54.880 --> 02:55.920
At this rate...

02:56.210 --> 03:00.580
Dammit! Kemet! Kemet, answer me!

03:01.580 --> 03:03.630
Those of you that can evacuate now, do so!

03:04.080 --> 03:06.040
Everyone else, clear away the rubble!

03:06.040 --> 03:06.750
Yes, sir!

03:07.080 --> 03:09.460
Kemet! Kemet!

03:13.040 --> 03:15.080
Arthur, evacuate that child as well.

03:25.540 --> 03:28.250
Well then, they'll head out first.

03:28.250 --> 03:29.170
But...

03:29.710 --> 03:31.130
Please take care of my younger brother.

03:34.460 --> 03:38.290
No! I'm staying with Val! Put me down!

03:38.540 --> 03:41.040
Captain Alan, please watch over everyone.

03:38.880 --> 03:40.460
I said, put me down!

03:41.210 --> 03:41.830
Yes, sir!

03:42.830 --> 03:45.960
Arthur! You absolutely cannot let Lady Jeanne die!

03:46.460 --> 03:47.130
Yes, Captain!

04:01.750 --> 04:02.500
Val.

04:02.500 --> 04:03.080
Huh?

04:09.130 --> 04:10.040
Kemet?!

04:13.460 --> 04:15.130
This is bad! We have to evacuate!

04:15.290 --> 04:17.960
That's enough! You guys get to the exit!

04:18.420 --> 04:19.250
Val?!

04:19.460 --> 04:20.960
We can't do something like that!

04:21.130 --> 04:22.420
You're leaving too!

04:22.670 --> 04:23.670
Stop that!

04:24.250 --> 04:28.080
Are you guys new recruits?
Or do you just not remember?!

04:28.880 --> 04:30.170
I am a criminal!

04:31.250 --> 04:36.380
I'm a serious criminal who was caught at an attack on the
knights and was taken further down by a fealty contract!

04:37.170 --> 04:39.040
Leave me be!

04:39.500 --> 04:40.210
Val!

04:40.210 --> 04:41.130
Don't say it!

04:43.000 --> 04:43.960
Don't say it.

04:45.080 --> 04:48.170
You will NOT order me to do anything!

04:52.580 --> 04:53.460
Val...

04:54.500 --> 04:56.500
with your bare hands and Earthen Wall special ability...

04:57.000 --> 04:58.040
Stop.

04:59.420 --> 05:01.290
Block us off.

05:08.920 --> 05:10.080
Thanks.

05:21.750 --> 05:25.170
Jeanne! Sir Arthur! Are you injured?

05:25.170 --> 05:27.540
No, we're fine. How's Philip?

05:27.830 --> 05:30.380
The knights are watching over him right now.

05:30.380 --> 05:31.670
Where are Kemet and Val?!

05:37.380 --> 05:39.170
The two of them are still in there.

05:42.830 --> 05:43.920
No, you can't!

05:43.920 --> 05:45.630
Let me go, you dummy!

05:46.540 --> 05:48.880
Kemet... and Val are...!

05:48.880 --> 05:50.040
What are you doing? Calm down.

05:51.040 --> 05:52.040
I hate this.

05:52.420 --> 05:57.670
If only this was something that happened in the game,
I may have known about it beforehand.

05:58.500 --> 06:01.630
I'm powerless, no matter how much time passes...

06:03.380 --> 06:04.210
Jeanne.

06:06.000 --> 06:09.830
To be honest, this is only a guess, but...

06:15.580 --> 06:17.250
Val!

06:18.290 --> 06:22.330
This is an order! If you can hear me then answer me!

06:22.790 --> 06:24.080
Why the hell are you there?!

06:24.380 --> 06:25.170
Is Kemet safe?

06:25.170 --> 06:28.580
Not yet, but he's right there! Y'all hurry up and get-

06:28.580 --> 06:31.580
Val! Remove the earthen wall right now!

06:31.580 --> 06:32.290
What?!

06:37.330 --> 06:38.580
Why'd you come back?!

06:38.880 --> 06:42.830
Val, reach out and grab Kemet's hand right now!

06:44.630 --> 06:46.630
Kemet! Hold on to Val's hand!

06:47.460 --> 06:52.380
Hey! What're you trying to do?! I can't pull him
through a hole like this by force!

06:53.330 --> 06:56.580
If you've grabbed Kemet's hand,
then with your special ability-

06:56.580 --> 07:00.080
You know I can't move this rubble with my ability!

07:00.080 --> 07:01.630
It's not just about the rubble!

07:02.960 --> 07:04.040
I got his hand!

07:05.580 --> 07:07.580
As your master, I order you!

07:09.790 --> 07:12.290
Control everything in this cave!

07:12.830 --> 07:13.540
I can't do...

07:34.540 --> 07:37.040
How the hell... did I do that?

07:44.420 --> 07:45.290
Kemet!

07:45.500 --> 07:46.580
Val!

07:48.080 --> 07:49.420
Stupid kid...

07:50.210 --> 07:57.170
Why're you two always...
doing stupid things... always, always...!

07:58.920 --> 08:00.080
I'm so glad.

08:03.250 --> 08:06.750
Did... Did you do this, Val?

08:07.330 --> 08:08.710
I don't know.

08:09.040 --> 08:12.540
No, it was you and Val who did that.

08:14.000 --> 08:19.670
Let's see... Kemet, what do you understand
about your special ability?

08:19.830 --> 08:22.080
Sefec's the only one who knows about it.

08:26.080 --> 08:28.170
To be honest, this is only a guess, but...

08:28.630 --> 08:37.130
there's a possibility that Kemet's special ability
is to increase the capacity of a user.

08:37.580 --> 08:39.290
Increase the capacity?

08:39.880 --> 08:41.330
Take a look at Sefec.

08:41.710 --> 08:45.710
That's how powerful her water ability is, however...

08:47.420 --> 08:52.500
When Sefec was holding Kemet's hand,
she sent those human trafficking men flying,

08:52.750 --> 08:54.880
and it was powerful enough to destroy the cell.

08:58.750 --> 09:00.210
I don't believe this.

09:01.130 --> 09:07.960
Sefec said that since my special ability is so incredible,
I can't know about it until I'm older.

09:26.460 --> 09:29.790
Wha?! No! No way no way no way?!

09:48.290 --> 09:49.750
What in the world is this?!

09:49.750 --> 09:51.170
Kemet! Val!

09:54.250 --> 09:57.080
Thank goodness... Thank goodness!

10:01.580 --> 10:04.540
"Yay, we're saved!"

10:05.250 --> 10:08.880
I wonder if that's what they're thinking. Huh.

10:09.460 --> 10:12.580
Ah, but they sure gave a good show.

10:12.830 --> 10:16.580
The ground, like, moved. What was that?

10:16.580 --> 10:20.040
A special ground ability or something?
What kind of guy was that?

10:20.880 --> 10:22.080
Tippet!

10:23.040 --> 10:26.420
You're making sure the knights don't notice us, right?

10:31.540 --> 10:38.580
Those bombs that fell earlier, it'd be a pain to carry
the remaining half home with us, wouldn't it?

10:56.580 --> 10:57.670
What's going on?

10:58.790 --> 11:01.080
Hey, Sefec! Kemet!

11:01.290 --> 11:02.250
Val!

11:06.580 --> 11:07.500
Sefec!

11:10.960 --> 11:13.500
You damn...!

11:15.670 --> 11:16.500
Val!

11:16.830 --> 11:19.290
Val!

11:20.580 --> 11:23.500
Why... did I end up like this?

11:24.380 --> 11:28.580
Me, of all people, doing this for a kid...

11:30.170 --> 11:32.920
I wouldn't have believed it myself a little while ago.

11:33.710 --> 11:37.790
Me, a pathetic, ruined man.

11:42.630 --> 11:47.580
My mother abandoned me in a low-class
trash dump when I was seven.

11:50.000 --> 11:55.330
Hit by stones, robbed...
I was almost killed on countless occasions.

12:09.080 --> 12:14.130
I jumped into a get-rich-quick proposal,
but in a few years, I'd lost everything,

12:14.670 --> 12:16.830
and I was reduced to being
a man under a fealty contract.

12:18.250 --> 12:23.130
After a nonsensical order, I was driven out of the castle.

12:28.750 --> 12:33.880
For the time being, I decided to go back to
the low-class residence for the first time in a while.

12:36.580 --> 12:38.500
There's nothing over there.

12:42.210 --> 12:45.790
Eh? You live here?

12:46.080 --> 12:50.130
Nope. Just sleeping, eating, and hiding here.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.460
Oh, really...

12:52.460 --> 12:53.670
Yeah, take that!

12:54.330 --> 12:55.330
Trash!

13:14.290 --> 13:15.710
You slept well, huh?

13:17.460 --> 13:19.290
Why are you here?

13:20.330 --> 13:25.420
Because I know that it's safest
to be next to someone like you.

13:25.420 --> 13:26.330
What?

13:29.330 --> 13:31.040
What's up with the little guy?

13:31.670 --> 13:33.580
He's my younger brother now.

13:34.210 --> 13:36.710
"Now"? So, he's a stranger?

13:37.040 --> 13:42.920
I'm sure you've got enough on your plate in a dump like
this, but what are you gonna do with all that baggage?

13:43.290 --> 13:47.170
He isn't baggage. He's the only family I have.

13:47.790 --> 13:51.710
Besides, if I'm not with him he'll be killed.

13:52.580 --> 13:54.880
And you expect me to be able to protect you?

13:55.040 --> 13:59.500
You can protect us from now on.
That's why I said I want to be around you.

13:59.500 --> 14:00.330
What?!

14:01.920 --> 14:04.420
At the beginning, I just kept running away.

14:05.130 --> 14:09.580
Until a few days before, I had been catching and
selling numerous kids that were about that size,

14:10.130 --> 14:13.000
but due to the fealty contract, I couldn't do that either.

14:35.210 --> 14:39.290
No matter where I went,
the kids silently followed after me.

14:36.670 --> 14:38.250
Hey, Val.

14:40.330 --> 14:44.960
I couldn't do anything about it,
so I treated it the same as if I didn't see them.

14:47.540 --> 14:48.710
I know, right?

14:52.830 --> 15:01.830
A month passed, then two, and at about the third month,
I had somewhat gotten used to them.

15:02.330 --> 15:03.580
Yo, kids.

15:04.790 --> 15:07.880
How long do you two plan on sticking around me?

15:09.000 --> 15:11.630
Um... forever?

15:11.920 --> 15:13.170
Seriously...?

15:15.080 --> 15:19.540
Mister... is your name Val?

15:20.080 --> 15:22.040
Yeah? And what about it?

15:23.210 --> 15:24.210
Val...

15:27.130 --> 15:29.630
Speaking of what're your names?

15:30.250 --> 15:32.420
"Trash"? "Vermin"?

15:32.420 --> 15:33.460
"Scum"?

15:34.540 --> 15:36.250
That's what everyone says.

15:36.580 --> 15:38.380
Ah, "Little Brother"!

15:40.750 --> 15:45.960
So I gotta live with "Trash" and "Scum"
for the rest of my life now?

15:47.830 --> 15:49.130
Annoying!

15:49.670 --> 15:51.960
Sefec, Kemet.

15:52.920 --> 15:55.040
From now on, call each other by those names.

15:55.290 --> 15:57.040
It's from a foreign language.

15:57.040 --> 16:00.130
"Sefec" is the number 7, "Kemet" is 3.

16:02.000 --> 16:05.540
Same as the ages you two should be around.

16:05.670 --> 16:08.460
Sefec, Kemet.

16:09.420 --> 16:12.420
Kemet, Sefec.

16:15.460 --> 16:20.750
From the next day on, the kids
started talking to me on their own.

16:21.750 --> 16:26.920
I had no choice but to tell them all about money.

16:28.170 --> 16:32.080
Soon after, the kids started
selling water and to earn some.

16:33.670 --> 16:37.830
That was also about the time that I learned
Sefec was a special ability user that produces water.

16:40.170 --> 16:41.290
Then...

16:47.460 --> 16:48.460
Eat this.

16:48.920 --> 16:49.830
Hot!

16:51.920 --> 16:54.040
We can have some too?!

16:54.380 --> 16:57.920
It's in return for the water.
I'm not interested in just taking it from you.

17:06.580 --> 17:07.630
Yummy!

17:08.000 --> 17:10.580
I've never had meat before!

17:14.420 --> 17:15.420
Kids...

17:24.040 --> 17:25.880
Val! Val!

17:25.880 --> 17:27.630
Yeah? What's up?

17:28.830 --> 17:30.580
I got a fish! A fish!

17:30.790 --> 17:32.790
I got a fish in exchange for the water!

17:32.790 --> 17:36.540
We got a big one 'cause they couldn't sell it!

17:36.540 --> 17:37.420
Wow.

17:37.420 --> 17:41.040
I heard it'd go bad in the sun so we're going home early!

17:41.040 --> 17:43.460
Come home early today, please!

17:43.460 --> 17:44.290
Sure.

17:47.500 --> 17:50.670
What's goin' on, Val?
Gettin' the family together for a meal today?

17:51.000 --> 17:52.880
Man, wish that were me!

17:53.420 --> 17:54.170
What?

17:56.040 --> 17:58.460
They're not really my family.

17:59.130 --> 18:03.080
We just eat together and sleep in the same bedroom.

18:12.540 --> 18:15.830
What the hell... are you doing?!

18:16.380 --> 18:17.710
Who're you?

18:17.080 --> 18:17.710
Val!

18:17.710 --> 18:18.540
Val!

18:25.540 --> 18:27.130
You our new merchandise?

18:37.210 --> 18:41.170
Hm? That man, he's not from this country.

18:41.500 --> 18:44.830
He's not? Then should we just kill him?

18:45.000 --> 18:45.790
Val!

18:46.210 --> 18:47.290
Shut yer traps!

18:48.830 --> 18:50.040
Y-you...!

18:51.170 --> 18:54.880
Nah, it'd be better to put him to good use.

18:55.920 --> 19:02.170
Bring five people here by evening two days from now.
You'll provide five people from this nation.

19:02.960 --> 19:05.710
Do that, I'll give you back those two kids.

19:06.670 --> 19:08.500
Best of luck!

19:19.130 --> 19:22.880
Which sort of punishment do you wish for?

19:23.750 --> 19:25.080
Val! Val!

19:26.210 --> 19:29.670
...even if you are attacked or
something precious is taken from you...

19:30.380 --> 19:31.330
Shut up!

19:33.790 --> 19:38.040
...you cannot resist or retaliate with your fists.

19:42.630 --> 19:43.880
Give 'em back...

19:45.330 --> 19:50.130
If you are ever faced with an impossible situation,

19:51.790 --> 19:54.080
Give 'em back... Give 'em back...

19:55.130 --> 19:58.380
and you wish from your heart for someone to help you,

19:58.710 --> 20:03.330
Give 'em back, give 'em back, give 'em back,
give 'em back, give 'em back!

20:04.290 --> 20:06.080
Come back to me.

20:07.500 --> 20:08.790
Give 'em back!

20:17.920 --> 20:24.210
I didn't have a single thing that was precious to me.
I'd never had anything like that.

20:25.380 --> 20:28.960
That's why I could carelessly do anything,
without a second thought.

20:30.380 --> 20:31.290
And yet...

20:36.330 --> 20:38.920
It wasn't too bad of a life, considering.

20:43.750 --> 20:45.830
Open your eyes, Val!

20:47.540 --> 20:48.290
Wha...

20:49.130 --> 20:51.960
This is an order! Grab onto my hand!

20:55.750 --> 20:58.250
What the hell are you doing?! You can't die-

20:58.250 --> 21:01.380
Neither can you! You're my subject, right?!

21:09.460 --> 21:10.580
Pride!

21:11.000 --> 21:12.080
Stale!

21:37.540 --> 21:39.460
Val!

21:42.630 --> 21:45.750
Shut it, you're hurting my ears.

21:49.750 --> 21:50.960
Seriously...

21:53.420 --> 21:55.210
This family is irritating.

23:28.830 --> 23:34.290
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:34.880 --> 23:38.790
Episode 12: "The Treacherous Princess
Faces the Future."

23:36.580 --> 23:41.040
<b>"The Treacherous Princess Faces the Future"</b>
